---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate initialization parameters
    q_validate --> q_check_fees: params valid
    q_validate --> q_revert_invalid: params invalid
    q_check_fees --> q_check_addresses: fee bps values valid (legion + referrer fees)
    q_check_fees --> q_revert_fees: invalid fee config
    q_check_addresses --> q_set_config: bidToken != address(0) AND projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_check_addresses --> q_revert_addr: invalid addresses
    q_set_config --> [*]: refundPeriodSeconds, bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry, fees configured, emit Initialized()
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_revert_fees --> [*]: revert InvalidFeeConfig
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress

    note right of q_set_config
        INV-001: No askToken at initialization (set during publishTgeDetails after TGE)
        INV-002: No fixed end time (sale continues until manually ended)
        INV-003: refundPeriodSeconds configures per-investor refund window (up to 2 weeks)
    end note
